  <h2>KovaaK's Install Folder Not Detected</h2>
  <p>
    If RefleK's can't find your KovaaK's installation automatically, you'll need
    to set it manually.
  </p>

  <h2>Manual Configuration</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open Settings (gear icon in the top right)</li>
    <li>Go to General → KovaaK's Install Folder</li>
    <li>
      Enter the path to your KovaaK's installation folder (the folder containing <code
        >FPSAimTrainer</code
      >)
    </li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Common Locations</h2>
  <p>The KovaaK's installation is typically at one of these locations:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <code>C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\FPSAimTrainer</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>D:\SteamLibrary\steamapps\common\FPSAimTrainer</code>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Finding Your KovaaK's Installation</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open Steam</li>
    <li>Right-click on KovaaK's in your library</li>
    <li>Select "Manage" → "Browse local files"</li>
    <li>You're now in the KovaaK's installation folder</li>
    <li>Copy this path to your RefleK's settings</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Verify the Folder</h2>
  <p>
    The KovaaK's installation folder should contain a <code>FPSAimTrainer</code> subfolder.
  </p>
  <p>Inside that subfolder, you should see:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><code>stats</code> folder (contains CSV files)</li>
    <li><code>performances</code> folder (contains performance data)</li>
  </ul>

